&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a href="https://dev.to/adminpackstudio/revocation-server-was-offline-0x80092013-a-read-first-crl-cdp-cache-and-offline-root-triage-59pf"&gt;Revocation Server Was Offline (0x80092013)&lt;/a&gt; (when the alert is a certificate or revocation code rather than a protocol or cipher mismatch)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

